{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1353.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8d13128978efeb39afb7653925f8051e125116a4cc0466af974ab582a7282782","ja":"私たちが演じたカップルが好評だからってことで、\n「ふたりが行きそうな大人デート」ってテーマで。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1353.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bfce153929582b67c3c6f8b9d1e31f44844b3b0db6f7f06e45bfa257534ac519","ja":"はい。それで、どんなデートをすればいいでしょう？\n大人のデートと言われても分からなくて……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1353.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3eb053dfbaaf90d545095fd999944bc2c6f05f1bdf4fe9ea3aa6d5388f700e42","ja":"そっか……志保ちゃんはまだ14歳だし、\n大人のデートって言われてもピンと来ないよね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1353.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c6f6f242a4e0511ce5100505073081bc29e66c4a2b8af75af4028fb2e98a8dff","ja":"よし。それじゃあここは私が大人として、\nデートコースを考えてもいいかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1353.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"be305fdc34d6a5d69472f758b93df53de4f250f7cdaf70d8c6cc13d88f497802","ja":"えっ、でも、風花さんだけに考えさせるなんて……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
